hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"38","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Mansoor, wa Yahya bin Musa, qala: Haddasana Abdur Razzaq, 'an Ma'mar, 'an Thabit, 'an Anas, qala: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sar aur daadhi mein sirf chaudah safed baal gine hain."
"39","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Muthanna, qala: Akhbarana Abu Dawud, qala: Haddasana Shu'ba, 'an Simak bin Harb, qala: Maine Jabir bin Samura ko suna, jab unse Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke safed baalon ke baare mein sawal kiya gaya, to unhone kaha: Jab wo apne sar mein tel lagate to us mein se safed baal nazar nahi aata tha, aur jab tel nahi lagate to us mein se kuch nazar aa jata tha."
"40","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Amr bin Walid Al-Kindi Al-Kufi, qala: Haddasana Yahya bin Adam, 'an Sharik, 'an Ubaidullah bin Umar, 'an Nafi', 'an Abdullah bin Umar, qala: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke safed baal to qareeb bees safed baal the."
"41","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Kuraib Muhammad bin Al-A'la, qala: Haddasana Muawiya bin Hisham, 'an Shayban, 'an Abu Ishaq, 'an Ikrima, 'an Ibn Abbas, qala: Abu Bakr ne kaha: Aye Rasoolullah, aap safed ho gaye hain. Farmaya: Mujhe Hud, Al-Waqi'a, Al-Mursalat, Amma yatasa'alun, aur Idha ash-Shamsu kuwwirat ne safed kar diya."
"42","[AI-translation] Haddasana Sufyan bin Waki', qala: Haddasana Muhammad bin Bishr, 'an Ali bin Salih, 'an Abu Ishaq, 'an Abu Juhaifa, qala: Unhon ne kaha: Aye Rasoolullah, hum dekhte hain ke aap safed ho gaye hain. Farmaya: Mujhe Hud aur uski bahnein ne safed kar diya hai."
"43","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Ali bin Hujr qala: Haddasana Shu'aib bin Safwan, 'an 'Abd al-Malik bin 'Umair, 'an Iyad bin Laqit al-'Ijli, 'an Abi Rimthah al-Taymi, Taym al-Rabab, qala: Main Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya, aur mere saath mera ek beta tha. Kehte hain: maine unhein dikhaaya, aur jab maine unhein dekha to maine kaha: Yeh Nabi Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam hain, unke jism par do hare libaas hain, aur unke baalon par safed baal ghalib hai aur unka safed baal surkh hai."
"44","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani' qala: Haddasana Sarij bin al-Nu'man qala: Haddasana Hammad bin Salama, 'an Simak bin Harb, qala: Jabir bin Samura se pucha gaya: Kya Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke sar mein safed baal the? Unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke sar mein koi safed baal nahi tha magar unke mafrak (baant) mein chand baal the, jab aap sallallahu alayhi wa sallam roghan lagate to roghan unhein chupa deta tha."
"45","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani' qala: Haddasana Hushaym qala: Haddasana 'Abd al-Malik bin 'Umair, 'an Iyad bin Laqit, qala: Akhbarani Abi Rimthah, qala: Main apne ek bete ke saath Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaya, to aap sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya yeh tumhara beta hai? Maine kaha: Haan, main iski gawahi deta hoon. Aap sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yeh tumhein nuqsan nahi pahunchayega aur tum isein nuqsan nahi pahunchaoge. Unhon ne kaha: Aur maine safed baal surkh dekhe. Abu 'Isa ne kaha: Is baab mein yeh sab se behtar aur wazeh hadith hai, kyunke sahih riwayat ke mutabiq Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko safed baal nahi pohancha. Aur Abi Rimthah ka naam Rifa'ah bin Yathribi al-Taymi hai."
